            "review_title": "Review at Mộc Vegetarian Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Han L\n10 contributions\n0\nAmazing vegetarian food with special ingredients.\nJun 2024 • Friends\nThis is really a gem in the busy district 1. Food is delicious and according to the staff, even the spring rolls are made from fruits and edible flowers. All the dishes had been carefully planned and prepared. The atmosphere in this place is like entering a secret garden. Your mood will immediately switch to the peaceful and relax mode. Wonderful experience in this beautiful place and the staff are so friendly and helpful. We had a wonderful time here for dinner.\nRead more\nWritten June 24, 2024",
